r:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%">BNDES Term Loan, due October 2045</span></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-225" decimals="-3" name="nfe:LongTermDebtExcludingLessorVariableInterestEntitiesLoans" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="f-887">380,154</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-226" decimals="-3" name="nfe:LongTermDebtExcludingLessorVariableInterestEntitiesLoans" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="f-888">376,923</ix:nonFraction>&#160;</span></td><td style="background-color:#cceeff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:114%">New Brazil Notes, due November 2029</span></td><td colspan="2" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-227" decimals="-3" name="nfe:LongTermDebtExcludingLessorVariableInterestEntitiesLoans" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" scale="3" id="f-8