t-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%">Condensed Consolidated Statements of Operations and Comprehensive (Loss) Income</span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:107%">.</span></div></ix:continuation></ix:continuation><div style="height:45pt;position:relative;width:100%"><div style="bottom:0;position:absolute;width:100%"><div style="text-align:center"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">34</span></div></div></div><hr style="page-break-after:always"/><div style="min-height:45pt;width:100%"><div style="margin-bottom:10pt;margin-top:10pt"><span style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;text-decoration:underline" href="#i53addf5e2f9145d8b9a7de5c3cf25a22_7">Table</a></span><span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;text-decoration:underline"><a style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#0000ff;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;text-decoration:underline" href="#i53addf5e2f9145d8b9a7de5c3cf25a22_7"> of Contents</a></span></div></div><ix:continuation id="f-1081-3"><div style="margin-top:12pt"><span style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Consolidated Segment Operating Margin is defined as net (loss) income, adjusted for selling, general and administrative expenses, transaction and integration costs, depreciation and amortization, asset impairment expenses, (gain) loss on sale of assets, interest expense, other (income) expense, net, loss on exting